<html xmlns:o='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office' xmlns:w='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40'>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Tenant Registration Agreement - SiteTrack</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: "Arial", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.6; padding: 40px; }
        h1 { font-size: 18pt; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px; text-transform: uppercase; border-bottom: 2px solid #000; padding-bottom: 10px; }
        h2 { font-size: 13pt; margin-top: 25px; margin-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc; padding-bottom: 5px; }
        p { margin-bottom: 15px; text-align: justify; }
        .signature-box { border: 2px solid #000; padding: 25px; margin-top: 40px; background-color: #fafafa; }
        .warning { color: #d9534f; font-weight: bold; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <h1>TENANT REGISTRATION & ASSUMPTION OF LIABILITY AGREEMENT</h1>
    <p>This Tenant Registration Agreement (the "Agreement") is an essential addendum to the SiteTrack Master Terms of Service. It must be explicitly agreed to by the authorized representative ("Tenant Administrator") of the registering fire safety company ("Customer") before gaining access to the SiteTrack platform ("Service").</p>

    <h2>1. BINDING DECLARATION OF LEGAL AUTHORITY</h2>
    <p>By checking the acceptance box during the digital registration process, or by physically signing this document, you formally declare, warrant, and guarantee that you are a legally authorised representative of the Customer business entity. You guarantee that you possess the full legal authority to bind the Customer entity to this Agreement and the SiteTrack Master Terms of Service.</p>

    <h2>2. EXPLICIT WAIVER OF PLATFORM LIABILITY</h2>
    <p>You explicitly acknowledge, understand, and agree that:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>SiteTrack is exclusively a digital software provider and data hosting service.</li>
        <li>SiteTrack is <span class="warning">NOT</span> an engineering firm, fire safety certifier, or compliance regulatory body.</li>
        <li>The Customer is <strong>100% solely and unconditionally responsible</strong> for the physical inspection, maintenance, and compliance of all fire safety systems managed through the platform, in strict accordance with AS 1851-2012 and all applicable Australian state laws.</li>
        <li>You completely and unconditionally waive any and all rights to hold SiteTrack liable for property damage, personal injury, death, or regulatory fines resulting from fire system failures, missed inspections, or inaccurate data entered by your personnel.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. FULL INDEMNIFICATION GUARANTEE</h2>
    <p>You agree to fully indemnify, defend, and pay for all legal defense costs of SiteTrack against any third-party lawsuits, claims, or regulatory actions (including but not limited to claims from building owners, strata managers, or government authorities) that arise as a result of the actions, inactions, or faulty fire safety work performed by the Customer, its technicians, or its subcontractors.</p>

    <h2>4. ACCEPTANCE OF ALL GOVERNING POLICIES</h2>
    <p>You confirm that you have read, understood, and unconditionally accept the entirety of the following documents, which collectively govern your use of the Service:</p>
    <ol>
        <li>The SiteTrack Master Terms of Service</li>
        <li>The SiteTrack Privacy Policy</li>
        <li>The SiteTrack Acceptable Use Policy</li>
    </ol>

    <div class="signature-box">
        <h2 style="margin-top: 0; text-align: center; border-bottom: none;">AGREEMENT DECLARATION</h2>
        <p><strong>[   ] I AGREE AND ACCEPT FULL LIABILITY</strong></p>
        <p><em>By checking the box provided in the digital registration portal, or by signing below, you electronically execute this legally binding contract on behalf of your fire safety company and accept all associated liability limitations.</em></p>
        <br><br>
        <p><strong>Company / Entity Legal Name:</strong> __________________________________________________</p><br>
        <p><strong>ABN (Australian Business Number):</strong> _______________________________________________</p><br>
        <p><strong>Printed Name of Authorised Administrator:</strong> _______________________________________</p><br>
        <p><strong>Signature:</strong> ____________________________________________________________________</p><br>
        <p><strong>Date:</strong> _________________________________</p>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
